## Rules drawn from the GrowLabs wiki

The rules whose sources include a `GL-*` id paraphrase pages of the GrowLabs wiki, which their author
publishes under CC BY-NC 4.0. Their author grants that material, as it appears in this doctrine pack, under the
MIT License above.

## Other sources

Facts and figures drawn from vendor guides, a university course, another open-source project's documentation
and published studies are paraphrased and cited in `09-sources.md`. No text from those works is reproduced, and
this licence does not cover the works themselves.
